      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每日锻练，每日迈进。\r\n毕竟唯有积累努力，才能为船桥\r\n带来荣耀……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d9acedb6331fbed5f96e2e57e70a7d3738b5002c10940fcd02cc57c2edb15e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0306fb339ad79bfa4d9f213",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终点已经明确。\r\n那么剩下的唯有前行了。\r\n出发……向着船桥的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bac8514e1a0ca4584d399048f9396f6e47b4e7a2c4159be93a0344bc050326a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c574862b2d72b91c33e56a1",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "和中央的孩子一起热身什么的……\n我明明没打算和她们搞好关系。\n……下次一定要拒绝。一定拒绝掉……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c1463bd0b039d482b66323804d23babe9217f97af8ed9099e9b24f61091426a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c6f6fd415c4aaf30dbe3386",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唔……集中，集中精神。\r\n为了故乡，\r\n必须做出成果……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0ed57e3f6ebb711704edca84ed7be119187bd014425faf9b50f3ba75403bed7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a85f7526edc71d10c00eb45",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我只要做该做的事就好。\r\n……仅此而已。\r\n不要去想多余的事……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96336ba68efc0c10df1af4d2401023f3052205e083d885b1ef348d795e40fc8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e722fba8b6fbc82766be152",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在我止步不前的时候，\r\n与中央的差距正在不断拉大……。\r\n可是……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa689b6e7b07ba7b9badb36fba40f7e4ac86571be26508b863bc42278a7019d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6140fd6f8acbd0cb2daed48f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……好想触摸一下，船桥的沙子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4570098bd7f96e889eb8dcf93761e21aa0dd0c3cbb7630422bccd319440d507b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:275b4a48304da8145ee738e9",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不认为胡乱参加比赛会是\r\n良策。中央，并没有那么好对付。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3de547cdf4464c61587456f8e9c695800dce2cf3b7995e44891e82845ea27ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a95aba3b8e8a8b5a62d39785",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果为船桥的未来着想，现在\r\n应该重整旗鼓。……盲目增加参赛次数，\r\n无异于愚策。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9888bcff151f9c2563a6d989815a09a29585e0097b1673e3b38e3ece360d637",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20022"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20022"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e14afd5e60045246734fd651",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在的我，已经没有无法战胜的敌人。\r\n问鼎最强宝座的，将会是船桥！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dfa12b1d07d73c475a864bd801d32d210f8e42de47936b544ac32f4cfbcf4d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20023"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20023"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20f51624db5c2585b834277b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "越过红色悲剧的尽头，\r\n蓝色之星终将闪耀……\r\n我一定会证明给你们看的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff884ce6844ee456fc3aaacd890781fb9318946d7878c2ce1fefa7c46b6722ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20024"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20024"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee7aea1fd3b4957ce19e625a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜败已是一目了然。\r\n接下来只需为了故乡，\r\n展现出我的力量即可。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39684c81c880fbf8a8f5d574f32bcdc07fc7d8cc285aaa23b623fb2f4cd48e50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20025"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20025"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af230f79f78d336a46ad970a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论是什么样的强者阻挡在前，\r\n我都会将其击溃。\r\n赌上船桥之名……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d6037b01bb329878e77225ef75c14361fc5b94ce97c35de385d346b8908279d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20026"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20026"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b360f60968dc701b6f9836ab",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "请交给我吧。\r\n我会回到你，还有故乡的大家身边——\r\n比任何人都要快地，回到那里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98192a967aa45d8ebecd313444ac49b580696221b976ab7b157edde9b93c8d82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20027"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20027"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14f7aaae8a74d48aaaa09a96",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "状态正佳。\r\n那么……我要去让观众席的气氛，\r\n全都染上船桥的色彩了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae2bd000fe578604850f2a305bbcdf3ac914d060529fe235d166eefdd78de146",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20028"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20028"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4bb4abe771aee24a39e9de7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要我们发挥如常，\r\n胜利定能手到擒来……。\r\n伸出的手，一定能触及荣光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d192c7fe7a15b40b011338cc91548d9f678313b5f6b993d4c353cab614ed59b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20029"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20029"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d15f5dbecf88549c364f22",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "心怀誓言，荣归故里。\r\n——狂怒乐章，出阵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75e1898bd05bdf6ee049711952af903865ffa1fa3cbb2b85c686c99d3101602f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20030"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20030"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:880d5a55a65e9f20ca2c8e88",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剩下的唯有展现结果了。\r\n我会全力以赴，展示船桥的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bc3071ed2e446db9f992ce4597bf1c9296c7688f76d583edfad06a8494ec12c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20031"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20031"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9ead87ffe2b5fbcbc536d36",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "纵使深处困境，也要夺取胜利……\r\n这正是展现船桥之魂的时候。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4da1751833ef096d429e03db1d316684694a382e1494657d3c0a5cbec31d100",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20032"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20032"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2da996bb94953ef77b377ef4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说调整不足是事实，\r\n但唯有战胜逆境，才是真正的强者。\r\n……不必为我担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7c59c61272ed3525bc149895f22ae7c4d43230e7ff35de411356b6adf4317bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20033"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20033"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92f80aef44b42c6e2076f4ff",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果连这种程度的苦难都无法逾越，\r\n梦想便遥不可及。\r\n……我绝不会认输。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37d2cbaba60730843ebe9f59f3024f172ed375ae49b02af7f4273ff8fa85d28f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
