      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20034"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72c1cfd1b44ee2c946f6bc38",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "父亲、母亲、船桥的大家——\r\n请给我勇气……给我前行的力量……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdfa895f7ce60774e8931ecc12ee4870b0b6df3c1d99d0143e2a2bb7555bb2c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20035"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1079/20035"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:623f6c7fd1c67981a1f5c3d2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "竟然聚集了这么多猛将……\r\n不，不能胆怯。\r\n我也……一定可以的……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99f984edb512d88beb1f2ce34af2fe45dcd8ecb99f50b75f49d00f98abd6a176",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
